{"id": "86267", "name": "Function_Minimum_2", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<p>Two positive numbers have product \\({{CT:0}}\\). Using calculus, find the smallest possible value of their sum.</p>\n<p>The smallest value of their sum is:  [[input:ans1]] [[validation:ans1]]</p>", "generalfeedback": "<p>The Product \\[ xy = {{CT:0}}\\]</p>\n<p>\\[y = \\frac{{CT:0}}{x}\\]</p>\n<p>\\[Sum = x + y = x +\\frac{{CT:0}}{x}= x + {{CT:1}}^{-1}\\]</p>\n<p>\\[\\frac{d(Sum)}{dx}= 1-{{CT:1}}^{-2} \\]</p>\n<p>To find the minimum \\(\\frac{d(Sum)}{dx}\\) = 0.</p>\n<p>Therefore</p>\n<p>\\[1-{{CT:1}}^{-2} = 0\\]</p>\n<p>\\[x^{2} = {{CT:0}}\\]</p>\n<p>\\[x = ±\\sqrt{{CT:0}}\\]</p>\n<p>\\(x\\) and \\(y\\) must be positive hence the minimum sum is \\[x + y = \\sqrt{{CT:0}}+\\sqrt{{CT:0}}={{CT:2}}\\]</p>", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:Result]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "<p><span class=\"correct\">Correct answer, well done.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p><span class=\"partially\">Your answer is partially correct.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p><span class=\"incorrect\">Incorrect answer.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "diff", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "Result", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "Diff", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "correctanswer", "testoptions": "v", "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-0-T ", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "Result-0-F ", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "wronganswer1", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-1-T ", "feedback": "<p>The numbers must be positive.</p>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": 2, "answernote": "Result-1-F ", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 2, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "wronganswer2", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-2-T ", "feedback": "<p>You forgot to do the sum.</p>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-2-F ", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["correctanswer", "f", "n1", "wronganswer1", "wronganswer2"], "nvariants": 19}